      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Initial testing shows it seems to be correctly role-restricting even through invites, so we need extra context to know if there's still an issue. Can you tell us the following?\n\n1. For the role that shouldn't have access to the instance, is it ranked higher than the _lowest_ role that is allowed in the instance?\n\n2. Does the role that shouldn't have access to the instance have instance moderation permissions?\n\nIf the disallowed role is above an allowed role AND has moderation permissions, it IS allowed to enter by design. If only one or none of the above are true, then it shouldn't be allowed to enter.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
