      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We managed to get more testing done on our end as well.\n\n1. The restricted role was lower than the allowed role\n\n2. The member did not have moderator permissions\n\nWith further testing we confirmed that the role restricted instance did not allow inviting, joining through the menu or through invite.  So in this case it may have been user error (the instance was not role restricted like we thought it was).\n\nHowever I would like to note that whether an instance is role restricted or not, and what roles are allowed to join it is in not clear in the UI.  The instance details only brings up the fact that it's a Group instance and nothing more.  I don't see it as 100% necessary but it may be a good Quality of Life change to have this information be visible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
